{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0164CfuSmTvVTWQefTqbi4oj","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# nightly-review (snapshot of my home dir, the relevant bits)\n2\t\n3\tA launchd user agent runs `bin/nightly-review.zsh` every night at 02:30. The\n4\tscript asks a headless coding agent to review yesterday's commits in\n5\t~/projects/shop and sends me the summary (or a failure note) over Telegram\n6\tvia `bin/notify.sh`.\n7\t\n8\tLayout, relative to my home:\n9\t\n10\t- `Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist` — loaded with\n11\t  `launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ...` on 2026-10-12\n12\t- `bin/nightly-review.zsh` — the job\n13\t- `bin/notify.sh` — Telegram notifier (works when run by hand)\n14\t- `Library/Logs/` — where the plist points stdout/stderr\n15\t- `launchctl-print.txt` — output of `launchctl print gui/501/com.vk.nightly-review`, captured 2026-10-18 09:10\n16\t\n17\tI have received nothing on Telegram since it was loaded: no summaries, no\n18\tfailure notes.\n19\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"561b9378-34ed-4d0d-85f4-5f5e3730d8b8","uuid":"9f92e3fe-87c3-48ff-852b-31f4030670cf","timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:09:34.447Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/h-QKdVcg/README.md","content":"# nightly-review (snapshot of my home dir, the relevant bits)\n\nA launchd user agent runs `bin/nightly-review.zsh` every night at 02:30. The\nscript asks a headless coding agent to review yesterday's commits in\n~/projects/shop and sends me the summary (or a failure note) over Telegram\nvia `bin/notify.sh`.\n\nLayout, relative to my home:\n\n- `Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist` — loaded with\n  `launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ...` on 2026-10-12\n- `bin/nightly-review.zsh` — the job\n- `bin/notify.sh` — Telegram notifier (works when run by hand)\n- `Library/Logs/` — where the plist points stdout/stderr\n- `launchctl-print.txt` — output of `launchctl print gui/501/com.vk.nightly-review`, captured 2026-10-18 09:10\n\nI have received nothing on Telegram since it was loaded: no summaries, no\nfailure notes.\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0164CfuSmTvVTWQefTqbi4oj","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
